hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"249","Muhammad bin Issa and Ahmad bin Al-Hussein bin Abbad told us, they said: Al-Hasan bin Bishr told us, Zuhair told us, on the authority of Abu Al-Zubayr, on the authority of Jabir, The Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, “forbade entering the water unless one wears an apron.”"
